Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?boards:=20qs95-5610:=20derate=20the=20DDR=20AC?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20timings=20above=2085=20=C2=B0C?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The timing file enables the periodic MR4 poll (DDR_SDRAM_CFG_3 at
0x5e080260 = 0x90080, DYN_REF_RATE_EN set) but leaves
TIMING_CFG_2[DERATE_VAL] at 0. IMX95RM Rev.5, 114.6.29: DERATE_VAL
"Enables you to specify the number of cycles used for de-rating DDR
SDRAM timing parameters when you set the dynamic refresh rate
DDR_SDRAM_CFG_3[DYN_REF_RATE_EN] and the monitored rate requires timing
parameter de-rating". Zero cycles means no de-rating at all.

Micron MT53E1G32D2FW (z42m data sheet, Table 209, "Temperature Derating"):
above 85 °C tRCD, tRAS, tRP and tRRD gain 1.875 ns and tRC 3.75 ns, and
the device reports it in MR4 OP[2:0] = 110b, "0.25x refresh, with
derating". The refresh rate was already followed by the controller; the
timings were not.

At 3733 MT/s (tCK = 0.536 ns) 1.875 ns is 3.5 cycles, so DERATE_VAL = 4
(2.14 ns). The timings programmed in this file sit exactly at the Micron
minimum (tRP 18.22 ns for 18 ns, tRCD 18.22 ns for 18 ns, tRAS 42.33 ns
for 42 ns), so there is no hidden margin to absorb the derating.

  TIMING_CFG_2 (0x5e08010C): 0x0005C18B -> 0x4005C18B

Hand edit of the generated file, on purpose: the value only takes effect
when MR4 asks for it, everything else is untouched.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 boards/qs95-5610/ddr/QS95_5610_4000MTS_FW2024.09_timing.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/boards/qs95-5610/ddr/QS95_5610_4000MTS_FW2024.09_timing.c b/boards/qs95-5610/ddr/QS95_5610_4000MTS_FW2024.09_timing.c
index b9cb2a2..da5b8b3 100644
--- a/boards/qs95-5610/ddr/QS95_5610_4000MTS_FW2024.09_timing.c
+++ b/boards/qs95-5610/ddr/QS95_5610_4000MTS_FW2024.09_timing.c
@@ -56,7 +56,8 @@ static struct ddrc_cfg_param ddr_dram_fsp0_ddrc_cfg[] = {
     {0x5e080100, 0x24A0321BU},
     {0x5e080104, 0xF8EE001BU},
     {0x5e080108, 0x2F2E3233U},
-    {0x5e08010C, 0x0005C18BU},
+    /* DERATE_VAL=4: IMX95RM TIMING_CFG_2[31:28]; Micron z42m Tab.209 +1.875 ns */
+    {0x5e08010C, 0x4005C18BU},
     {0x5e080124, 0x1C030000U},
     {0x5e080160, 0x00009102U},
     {0x5e08016C, 0x35F00000U},
